{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Manastorm caches only give gear the opener can use",
  "contract": "A level 17 Necromancer (armor skill: cloth only) opens 100 Manastorm Cache (11-24) items (97877) through the real open path: open the item, take the first loot slot, release. Every piece received must be usable by the character now: no piece needs an armor or weapon skill the character lacks, and no piece needs a level above 17. The cache table holds 765 gear rows, 399 of them above level 17; before the selector checked usability about 55 of 100 pieces needed a missing skill and about 52 a higher level. The snapshot step \"cache_gear_report\" records the received pieces. Four 36-slot bags (23162) hold the pieces.",
  "timeout_ms": 600000,
  "location": {
    "map": 0,
    "x": -8914,
    "y": -133,
    "z": 80.6
  },
